# Avantor Brand Colors

Official brand colors from https://www.brandcolorcode.com/avantor. Always use these CSS custom properties when styling — never hardcode the hex values directly.

## CSS Variables (defined in `styles/styles.css`)

| Variable | Hex | Pantone | Use for |
|---|---|---|---|
| `--color-brand-blue` | `#226192` | 647 C | Primary brand color, CTAs, headers |
| `--color-brand-light-blue` | `#2dc2fd` | 298 C | Accents, highlights, hover states |
| `--color-brand-green` | `#04d367` | 2420 C | Positive states, success, badges |

## Semantic aliases

- `--color-brand` → `--color-brand-blue`
- `--color-accent` → `--color-brand-light-blue`
- `--color-positive` → `--color-brand-green`

## Usage rules

- Use `--color-brand` for primary buttons, links, and brand moments
- Use `--color-accent` for hover states, highlights, and secondary CTAs
- Use `--color-positive` for success states, availability indicators, and sustainability messaging
- Maintain sufficient contrast against white (`#fff`) backgrounds — `--color-brand-blue` passes WCAG AA
